---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Victor Pass">
    <article class="page">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>

        <h1>Victor Pass</h1>

        <p class="intro">
            I'm Stephen Smithwick. Victor Pass is my company — one
            engineer, in Colorado Springs.
        </p>

        <h2>Background</h2>

        <p>
            Twenty years of building backends: distributed systems and
            infrastructure at Amazon and Snowflake, platform and principal
            engineering before that in Sydney. Kinesis, SageMaker,
            DynamoDB, and a long tail of things that had to stay up.
        </p>

        <p>
            These days most of my attention is on local LLMs, agent
            tooling, and the unglamorous problem of getting the right
            context in front of a model.
        </p>

        <p>
            Victor Pass is small on purpose. My working hours are
            genuinely limited, so I'd rather build one tool properly than
            four badly.
        </p>

        <h2>How I work</h2>

        <p>
            In the open, further upstream than is comfortable. Ideas get a
            page while they're still speculative, and when I abandon
            something I say so and leave the page up, because "I tried
            this and it didn't work" is more useful to the next person
            than silence.
        </p>

        <p>
            I've been writing this way for nine years at CodeVantage —
            forty-odd posts, most of it thinking out loud in public.
        </p>

        <h2>If you run something in Colorado Springs</h2>

        <p>I'm interested in problems, not leads.</p>

        <p>
            If some part of your work is slow, manual, or held together by
            a spreadsheet nobody else wants to touch, I'd like to hear
            about it. No pitch attached, and I'm not going to try to sell
            you software on a first conversation. I'm local and happy to
            come to you.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
            <a href="mailto:hello@victorpass.dev">hello@victorpass.dev</a>
        </p>
    </article>
</Layout>

<style>
    .page {
        max-width: 800px;
        padding: 6rem 0;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        opacity: 0.65;
    }

    h1 {
        margin: 0 0 2rem;
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
        line-height: 0.95;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    h2 {
        margin-top: 4rem;
    }

    p {
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .intro {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        opacity: 0.75;
    }
</style>
